"Temporary buffers and safety reserve" = "暫存與安全預留";
"This estimate leaves little memory for macOS and other apps." = "此估算留給 macOS 與其他 App 的記憶體不多。";
"Install a usable model to estimate memory." = "安裝可用的模型後即可估算記憶體。";
