"MLX memory guideline GiB" = "MLX 記憶體指導值 GiB";
"0 selects the automatic guideline. This does not reserve memory." = "0 代表自動選擇指導值。這不會預先占用記憶體。";

/* Concise settings descriptions and navigation */
"Retain more experts to reduce SSD reads, at the cost of memory. Applies on next load." = "保留更多專家以減少 SSD 讀取，但會增加記憶體用量。下次載入生效。";
"May speed up generation, but uses more memory and can be slower for some requests." = "可能加快生成，但會增加記憶體用量，部分請求反而較慢。";
"Reject weak drafts earlier, but fewer accepted drafts may reduce the speed gain. 0 keeps all drafts." = "調高可提早排除低信心草稿，但可能減少加速效果。0 保留所有草稿。";
"May speed up generation, but answer quality may drop. Unavailable with MTP or DSpark." = "可能加快生成，但回答品質可能下降。無法與 MTP 或 DSpark 同時使用。";
"Save memory, but compression adds work and may slightly affect answer quality." = "節省記憶體，但壓縮會增加運算，回答品質可能略受影響。";
"Reduce cache quantization error, but may use more memory." = "減少快取量化誤差，但可能增加記憶體用量。";
"May shorten prefill, but needs extra memory and may slightly change output." = "可能縮短 prefill 時間，但需要額外記憶體，輸出可能略有差異。";
"More ANE work may shorten prefill, but adds memory use and may change output. 0 uses GPU only." = "調高可能縮短 prefill 時間，但會增加記憶體用量，輸出可能略有差異。0 僅使用 GPU。";
"Shorten prefill, but peak memory may rise and output may differ slightly." = "縮短 prefill 時間，但記憶體峰值可能上升，輸出可能略有差異。";
"Shorten prefill, but may use more memory. Requires layer-major prefill with MTP off." = "縮短 prefill 時間，但可能增加記憶體用量。需啟用 layer-major prefill 並關閉 MTP。";
"Larger batches may shorten prefill, but raise peak memory. 0 selects automatically." = "調高可能縮短 prefill 時間，但會提高記憶體峰值。0 為自動選擇。";
"Avoid whole-layer overhead on shorter prompts, but fewer prompts benefit from faster prefill." = "調高可減少短輸入的整層載入開銷，但較少請求能享有 prefill 加速。";
"Reduce SSD waiting, but may need more temporary memory." = "減少等待 SSD 的時間，但可能需要更多暫存記憶體。";
"More workers may reduce SSD waiting, but use more memory; too many can slow things down." = "調高可能減少 SSD 等待，但會增加記憶體用量，過多反而可能變慢。";
"Off saves memory but repeats work. Memory reuses quickly but clears on unload. Disk survives restarts but adds I/O." = "不使用：省記憶體，但每次重算。記憶體：重用快，但卸載後清除。磁碟：重啟後可用，但增加讀寫。";
"Keep more conversation history to shorten repeated prefill, at the cost of memory." = "調高可保留更多對話快取、縮短重複輸入的等待，但會增加記憶體用量。";
"LRU adapts quickly but forgets older use. LFU favors frequent use but adapts slowly. Route-aware balances layers but adds bookkeeping." = "LRU：適應快，但易忘記較早使用。LFU：保留常用專家，但適應慢。路由感知：平衡各層，但增加管理開銷。";
"Speed up attention search, but limiting candidates may affect output." = "加快注意力搜尋，但限制候選範圍可能影響輸出。";
"Shorten prefill and reduce temporary memory; full-model validation is still limited." = "縮短 prefill 時間並減少暫存，但完整模型驗證仍有限。";
"Allow longer answers, but generation may take more time and memory." = "調高可容納更完整的回答，但生成可能更久、記憶體用量更多。";
"Increase answer variety, but responses may be less consistent." = "調高可增加回答變化，但穩定性可能降低。";
"Consider more candidates for varied answers, but responses may be less focused. 0 removes the limit." = "調高可增加候選與回答變化，但可能較不聚焦。0 不限制候選數。";
"Choose sampling for chat or thinking automatically, overriding the manual values below." = "自動選擇適合對話或思考的取樣設定，但會取代下方手動值。";
"A higher guideline may reduce waiting, but allows more memory use. 0 is automatic; too little memory can fail requests." = "調高可能減少等待，但允許更多記憶體用量。0 為自動；記憶體不足可能導致請求失敗。";
"Prepare matching prompts for faster reuse, but add startup time and cache memory." = "預先準備相符輸入以加快重用，但會增加啟動時間與快取用量。";
"Save cache memory, but packing and unpacking may slow processing." = "節省快取記憶體，但打包與解包可能增加處理時間。";
"Status" = "狀態";
"About" = "關於";
"Playground" = "試用區";
"Install the DSpark files before enabling this setting." = "請先安裝 DSpark 檔案再啟用。";

