"Retain more experts to reduce SSD reads, at the cost of memory. Recommended: about %@ GiB. Applies on next load." = "保留更多專家以減少 SSD 讀取，但會增加記憶體用量。建議約 %@ GiB，下次載入生效。";
"Retain more experts to reduce SSD reads, at the cost of memory. Default: about %@ GiB. Applies on next load." = "保留更多專家以減少 SSD 讀取，但會增加記憶體用量。預設約 %@ GiB，下次載入生效。";
"More ANE work may shorten prefill, but adds memory use and may change output. Default and recommended: 0; 0 uses GPU only, 1 uses ANE only." = "調高可能縮短 prefill 時間，但會增加記憶體用量，輸出可能略有差異。預設值與建議值為 0；0 僅使用 GPU，1 僅使用 ANE。";
"Default settings" = "預設設定";
"Restore defaults" = "恢復成預設值";
