"Confirm restoring defaults" = "再次確認恢復預設值";
"Continue" = "繼續";
"Restore all advanced settings for this model, including generation settings. Alias and model files are kept." = "恢復此模型的所有進階設定，包含生成設定。保留 Alias 與模型檔案。";
"Your custom advanced settings will be replaced and saved immediately. This cannot be undone." = "自訂進階設定將被取代並立即儲存。此操作無法復原。";
"Larger batches may shorten prefill, but raise peak memory. 0 automatically selects 128, 256, or 1024. Default: 0." = "調高可能縮短 prefill 時間，但會提高記憶體峰值。預設 0，依輸入長度自動選擇 128、256 或 1024。";
"Avoid whole-layer overhead on shorter prompts, but fewer prompts benefit from faster prefill. Default: 1024." = "調高可減少短輸入的整層載入開銷，但較少請求能享有 prefill 加速。預設 1024。";
"More workers may reduce SSD waiting, but use more memory; too many can slow things down. Recommended: 4." = "調高可能減少 SSD 等待，但會增加記憶體用量，過多反而可能變慢。建議值為 4。";
"More workers may reduce SSD waiting, but use more memory; too many can slow things down. Default: 2." = "調高可能減少 SSD 等待，但會增加記憶體用量，過多反而可能變慢。預設為 2。";
"Keep more conversation history to shorten repeated prefill, at the cost of memory. Recommended: %lld." = "調高可保留更多對話快取、縮短重複輸入的等待，但會增加記憶體用量。建議值為 %lld。";
"Keep more conversation history to shorten repeated prefill, at the cost of memory. Recommended: 8 GiB." = "調高可保留更多對話快取、縮短重複輸入的等待，但會增加記憶體用量。建議值為 8 GiB。";

"Seed" = "Seed";

"Automatic" = "自動";

"Applies to the next message only. Blank uses a random seed." = "只套用到下一則訊息。留空則使用隨機值。";

"Enter a whole number from 0 to 4294967295, or leave blank for automatic." = "請輸入 0 到 4294967295 的整數，或留空使用自動值。";

/* Qwen Flash opt-in experiments */
"Qwen Flash experiments" = "Qwen Flash 實驗功能";
"Experimental; full-model speed and quality are not yet verified. All four controls default to off or mmap." = "實驗性功能；尚未驗證完整模型的速度與品質。這四個控制項預設皆為關閉或 mmap。";
"Saved automatically for this model. Changes apply on the next model load. Unload the model before editing." = "設定會依模型自動儲存，並於下次載入模型時生效。修改前請先卸載模型。";
"Unload this model to edit these settings. Loading and unloading also lock the controls." = "請先卸載此模型再修改設定。載入與卸載過程中也無法修改。";
"Experts per wave" = "每波專家數";
"0 disables waves; 1–512 limits the experts acquired per wave, capped by the expert cache. This is not a total memory limit. Small waves may be slower." = "0 關閉分波；1–512 限制每波取得的專家數，且不超過專家快取容量。這不是總記憶體上限；較小的波次可能更慢。";
"Expert waves temporarily disable whole-layer batching, next-layer prefetch, and grouped prefill. Their saved choices are restored when waves are disabled." = "專家分波會暫時停用整層批次計算、下一層預讀與分組 prefill。關閉分波後會恢復這些選項原本儲存的設定。";
"N-gram read backend" = "N-gram 讀取方式";
"mmap is the default. Buffered pread reads selected rows explicitly; it is not direct SSD-to-GPU I/O and may be slower." = "預設為 mmap。使用緩衝的 pread 會明確讀取所選資料列；這不是 SSD 直接傳送至 GPU，也可能更慢。";
"mmap (default)" = "mmap（預設）";
"pread (experimental)" = "pread（實驗性）";
"N-gram row cache MiB" = "N-gram 資料列快取 MiB";
"0 disables retention; 1–512 MiB retains packed FP8 rows with pread. Metadata, temporary buffers and the OS page cache are extra. The saved size is inactive with mmap." = "0 不保留快取；1–512 MiB 在 pread 模式保留 packed FP8 資料列。不含中繼資料、暫存緩衝區與系統頁面快取。切回 mmap 時保留設定值，但不使用這份快取。";
"Use fused QSA SDPA" = "使用融合 QSA SDPA";
"Uses the same selected attention cells with a fused kernel. Floating-point rounding and generated text may differ; a speed improvement is not guaranteed." = "以融合核心處理相同的注意力選取位置。浮點捨入與生成文字可能不同，且不保證加速。";
"Experts per wave must be an integer from 0 to 512." = "每波專家數必須為 0 至 512 的整數。";
"Choose mmap or pread for the N-gram read backend." = "N-gram 讀取方式請選擇 mmap 或 pread。";
"N-gram row cache must be an integer from 0 to 512 MiB." = "N-gram 資料列快取必須為 0 至 512 MiB 的整數。";

"Compile Qwen tensor operations" = "編譯 Qwen 張量運算";
"Compiles grouped normalization and single-token hyper-connection operations. Multi-token batches keep the original mixing path. Rounding and generated text may change." = "編譯分組正規化與單 token 的超連接運算。多 token 批次保留原本的混合路徑。浮點捨入與生成文字可能改變。";

// QSA throughput experiments.
"Experimental; full-model speed and quality are not yet verified. New QSA controls retain the original chunk size and disable indexed attention by default." = "實驗功能；完整模型的速度與品質尚未驗證。新的 QSA 控制項預設維持原本批次大小，並關閉索引注意力。";
"QSA queries per chunk" = "每批 QSA 查詢數";
"1–128 queries per attention chunk; default 4. Try 16 or 32 for prefill. Estimated per-chunk workspace is capped at 256 MiB; this is not a process memory limit. Numerical rounding may differ." = "每批注意力處理 1–128 個查詢，預設 4。Prefill 可試 16 或 32；每批工作區估算上限為 256 MiB，不是程序記憶體上限。浮點捨入可能不同。";
"Use indexed QSA decode" = "使用索引式 QSA 解碼";
"Requires fused QSA SDPA. Reads selected KV rows directly for up to 8 queries above the sparse threshold. Prefill and unsupported layouts keep the gathered path. FP32 reduction can change generated text." = "需啟用融合 QSA SDPA。超過稀疏門檻且不超過 8 個查詢時，直接讀取選中的 KV 列。Prefill 與不支援的格式維持 gather 路徑。FP32 歸約可能改變生成文字。";
"QSA queries per chunk must be an integer from 1 to 128." = "每批 QSA 查詢數必須為 1 到 128 的整數。";
